# Sport EuroTour - redirect map
# Cloudflare reads this file automatically. Format:  /old-path  /new-path  status
# First match wins, so specific rules MUST come above wildcards.
#
# Created Aug 14, 2026. The July 17 cutover from WordPress shipped without a redirect
# map, so every old WordPress URL was returning 404 and passing nothing to the new site.
# The full old URL list was recovered from the WordPress database via WP Engine
# phpMyAdmin (install "worldcampusa", table wp_posts) before that account is cancelled.
#
# *** CRITICAL RULE, LEARNED THE HARD WAY ON AUG 14 ***
# NEVER use a destination ending in ".html" or "/index" in this file.
# This site runs on Cloudflare Workers static assets, which automatically strips
# ".html" and "/index" from URLs. A rule pointing at /index.html is seen as a possible
# infinite loop, and Cloudflare rejects the ENTIRE _redirects file and FAILS THE WHOLE
# DEPLOY. Not just that rule. The whole site stops updating.
# The first version of this file used /index.html and killed build #eb896b56 with:
#   "Invalid _redirects configuration: Line 55: Infinite loop detected in this rule."
# Always use the clean destination:  /  or  /itinerary27  or  /terms
#
# NOT LISTED HERE ON PURPOSE: /terms/, /privacy/, /questions/, /members26/,
# /itinerary27/ and /index/ already resolve correctly on their own, because Cloudflare
# matches the slug to the matching .html file. Adding rules for those would loop.

